{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/6506","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/6506/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/6506/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/6506/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/6506","id":126874193,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMjY4NzQxOTM=","number":6506,"title":"Angular 2, IE9 & pushState issue!","user":{"login":"andycwk","id":2248787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDg3ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2248787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk","html_url":"https://github.com/andycwk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andycwk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null},{"id":218063111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTgwNjMxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/effort2:%20days","name":"effort2: days","color":"bfe5bf","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2016-01-15T13:39:13Z","updated_at":"2019-09-08T13:21:15Z","closed_at":"2016-05-26T16:49:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi,\n\nI'm having some issues with Angular 2, pushState & IE9 as I've documented initially in https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/angular/TdCt6KyhwI8 before carrying out much more investigation!\n\nI've read https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/5792 and attempted to apply the history.js script with mixed results!\n\nI have had to modify angular2.dev.js locally to return window.History instead of window.history (not a long term solution really!)\n\nIn Everything but IE9 things work as expected using path location mode - in IE9 history.js takes over and injects urls to look like http://my.app.com/#./dashboard\n\nBut those hashtag paths are then not recognised by the angular router..!!\n\nSo I turn on the hash location strategy and that works fine in chrome etc but in IE history.js kicks in and alerts the following..\n\n> > History.js does not support states with fragment-identifiers (hashes/anchors). \n\nThe root issue is found in the following code in the router..\n\n```\n    PlatformLocation.prototype.pushState = function(state, title, url) {\n        console.log('pushState line 2022');\n      this._history.pushState(state, title, url);\n      console.log('after push line 2026');\n    };\n```\n\nIf I comment out the pushState line then everything works.. but of course the url is not updated in the browser window :(\n\nIt feels a bit like a catch-22 situation!!\n\na) Is this a bug??\nb) Does the Angular team have a compatible IE9 routing solution?\n\nHelp!!!\n","closed_by":{"login":"mhevery","id":111951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTk1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery","html_url":"https://github.com/mhevery","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhevery/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/6506/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/6506/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}